[0.003, "o", "\u001b[33;1H\u001b[38;5;248m\u001b[48;5;255m\u276f \u001b[38;5;16mOK the only differences were oz vs OZ, things like that. Let's lowercase everything (I think casing differences don't\u001b[39m \u001b[34;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m matter).\u001b[39m                                                                                                             \u001b[35;1H                                                                                                                        \u001b[36;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mThen, I want to try swapping in a different model\u001b[39m                                                                     \u001b[37;3H\u001b[49m     \u001b[C \u001b[C    \u001b[C  \u001b[C   \u001b[C        \u001b[C  \u001b[C \u001b[C         \u001b[C      \r\n\u001b[38;5;174m\u273d\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mCascading\u2026 \u001b[39m                                                                                                           \u001b[39;1H\u001b[38;5;241m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39m\u001b[40;120H\n\u001b[38;6H\u001b[38;5;241mTip: Use git worktrees to run multiple Claude s\u001b[Cssions in parallel.\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
