[0.004, "o", "\u001b[31;1H\u001b[38;5;248m\u001b[48;5;255m\u276f \u001b[38;5;16mOK that was surprisingly good, here's the diff:\u001b[39m                                                                       \u001b[32;1H                                                                                                                        \u001b[33;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m> receipt-scanner-demo@1.0.0 eval\u001b[39m                                                                                     \u001b[34;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m> tsx test/eval.ts --model api-mistral-small-3.2-2506\u001b[39m                                                                 \u001b[35;1H                                                                                                                        \u001b[36;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mFound 1 fixture(s)\u001b[39m                                                                                                    \u001b[37;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mModel: api-mistral-small-3.2-2506\u001b[39m                                                                                     \u001b[38;1H                           \u001b("]
[0.0, "o", "B\u001b[m\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[5S\u001b[33;28H\u001b[48;5;255m                                                                                             \u001b[34;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m--- grocery-receipt ---\u001b[39m                                                                                               \u001b[35;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m  FAIL: 5 difference(s):\u001b[39m                                                                                              \u001b[36;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m    store:\u001b[39m                                                                                                            \u001b[37;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m      expected: null\u001b[39m                                                                                                  \u001b[38;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m      actual:   \"Unexpected\"\u001b[39m                                                                                          \u001b[39;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m    date:\u001b[39m                                                                                                             \u001b[40;1H  \u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[6S\u001b[34;3H\u001b[38;5;16m\u001b[48;5;255m      expected: null\u001b[39m                                                                                                  \u001b[35;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m      actual:   \"2023-05-15\"\u001b[39m                                                                                          \u001b[36;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m    subtotal:\u001b[39m                                                                                                         \u001b[37;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m      expected: null\u001b[39m                                                                                                  \u001b[38;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m      actual:   76.22\u001b[39m                                                                                                 \u001b[39;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m    items[8].name:\u001b[39m                                                                                                    \u001b[40;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m      expected: \"6 Pack Yogurt Straw Banana\"\u001b[39m                                         \u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[7S\u001b[33;88H\u001b[48;5;255m                                 \u001b[34;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m      actual:   \"YOGURT STRAW BANAN\"\u001b[39m                                                                                  \u001b[35;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m    items[16].name:\u001b[39m                                                                                                   \u001b[36;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m      expected: \"Pinapp Juice 8.45 OZ 4 P\"\u001b[39m                                                                            \u001b[37;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m      actual:   \"PINAP JUICE 8.45 OZ 4 P\"\u001b[39m                                                                             \u001b[38;1H                                                                                                                        \u001b[39;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mThere's actually a prompting/design decision here, which is if we want the raw text from the receipt or we want some \u001b[39m \u001b[40;1H  \u001b[38;5;16minterpretation of the item name. Probably both? May\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[2S\u001b[38;54H\u001b[38;5;16m\u001b[48;5;255mbe in two passes? Seems like a rich space for experimentation\u001b[39m      \u001b[49m\u001b[39;1H\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;174m\u00b7\u001b[CRazzle-dazzl\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;216ming\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;174m\u2026\u001b[39m\u001b[40;120H\n\r\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;241m\u23bf\u001b[C\u00a0\u001b[39m\r\u001b[2S\u001b[38;6H\u001b[38;5;241mTip:\u001b[CRun\u001b[C/install-github-app\u001b[Cto\u001b[Ctag\u001b[C@claude\u001b[Cright\u001b[Cfrom\u001b[Cyour\u001b[CGithub\u001b[Cissues\u001b[Cand\u001b[CPRs\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[39m\u001b[40;120H\n\r\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;241m\u276f\u00a0\u001b[39m\u001b[40;120H\n\u001b[39;3H\u001b[7m \u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
